	(text_box "BOOT\n\nWith BMS=1 (high):\n1- SPI Serialflash NPCS0 (Our AT45 boot)\n2- SPI DataFlash NPCS0\n3- SPI Serialflash NPCS1  (EK's AT45 boot)\n4- SPI DataFlash NPCS1\n5- NANDFLASH boot         (Our NAND)\n6- SD Card boot: boot.bin file in FAT12/16/32 in SD slot A (Our SDslot)\n7- DBGU / USB SAM-BA                                        (Our SAMBA)\n\nBMS should always be 1\nWe control boot with the power of the AT45 flash with a default on button\nNever write boot code to the first sector of the NAND. Else we'll need to short its CS or Pwr pins on boot\nto reach SAM-BA\n\n\nOSCSEL = 1\n- This enables USB DBGU if external 32k xtal exists"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 403.86 22.86 0)
		(size 68.58 50.8)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aeb1603f-136b-4a9a-85be-836a4e74c6e0")
	)
	(text_box "Optional second USB host"
